---
description: Prepare one constructTeams evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: VolunteerCapability[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Build feasible team configurations that collectively cover mission requirements and supervision. Use exact scheduling and capacity checks, explain role assignments, and preserve fair application of supplied assignment principles rather than optimizing convenience alone. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
